WEBVTT

00:00:25.292 --> 00:00:26.500
Damn!

00:00:27.667 --> 00:00:31.292
Friggin' trash!

00:00:50.042 --> 00:00:52.792
Who are you two?

00:00:52.792 --> 00:00:56.292
How about I give you power?

00:00:56.292 --> 00:00:59.625
Doing that won't accomplish anything, man.

00:00:59.625 --> 00:01:02.792
You hate them, right?
You want to get back at them, don't you?

00:01:02.792 --> 00:01:06.125
Those guys who made an ass of you?

00:01:06.125 --> 00:01:09.792
Then <i>do </i>just that! There's nothing stopping you.

00:01:09.792 --> 00:01:11.833
You've been chosen.

00:01:11.833 --> 00:01:14.333
You don't have to worry about those swine.

00:01:14.333 --> 00:01:17.167
Kill them! Do them in!

00:01:17.167 --> 00:01:19.833
Kill them! End their lives!

00:01:19.833 --> 00:01:23.292
And become a demon.

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:34.583
I'll show you what we call the Dark Arts.

00:01:40.792 --> 00:01:43.083
<i>Time to die!</i>

00:01:45.167 --> 00:01:48.042
<i>The perfect world!</i>

00:01:48.042 --> 00:01:55.458
<i>We exchanged promises...</i>

00:01:55.458 --> 00:01:58.125
<i>Let's break the spine!</i>

00:01:58.125 --> 00:02:02.958
<i>...under the moonlight</i>

00:02:02.958 --> 00:02:07.917
<i>At midnight, whispering like a roar</i>

00:02:07.917 --> 00:02:13.333
<i>In the silence and bustle of your current situation</i>

00:02:13.333 --> 00:02:18.458
<i>Do you feel like you're gonna go crazy and break?</i>

00:02:18.458 --> 00:02:22.417
<i>But live your own way, yeah, like you are</i>

00:02:22.417 --> 00:02:26.292
<i>That perfect world!</i>

00:02:26.292 --> 00:02:31.500
<i>Let's not be chameleons</i>

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:36.625
<i>But change ourselves from the inside</i>

00:02:36.625 --> 00:02:40.333
<i>I can hear those words</i>

00:02:40.333 --> 00:02:46.875
<i>Let's shout out so that the</i>
<i>dawn will break all nights</i>

00:02:46.875 --> 00:02:50.583
<i>Gently and furiously</i>

00:02:50.583 --> 00:03:02.125
<i>Let's shout out so that the</i>
<i>dawn will rip apart all nights</i>

00:03:12.333 --> 00:03:14.917
No!

00:03:14.917 --> 00:03:18.042
Help me, Aoi!

00:03:18.042 --> 00:03:21.125
Help me!

00:03:43.042 --> 00:03:44.042
"Dark Arts Chapter"

00:03:44.042 --> 00:03:45.542
"Dark Arts Chapter"
"Third Night"

00:03:45.833 --> 00:03:47.500
"Inhuman Powers"

00:03:48.625 --> 00:03:51.500
Good morning!

00:04:05.625 --> 00:04:07.375
Aoi!

00:04:16.458 --> 00:04:19.208
Gotta love summer uniforms, huh?

00:04:19.208 --> 00:04:23.833
Girls should have to wear short
sleeves whether it's hot or cold.

00:04:23.833 --> 00:04:26.625
Or even better: swimsuits!

00:04:26.625 --> 00:04:29.375
That'd be like sexual harassment.

00:04:29.375 --> 00:04:31.708
Ah, lighten up, man.

00:04:32.708 --> 00:04:38.875
Say, this summer, let's head down
to the beach and pick up some babes!

00:04:41.417 --> 00:04:44.667
You're not really considering that at all.

00:04:44.667 --> 00:04:48.958
Sheesh, at least let me enjoy
fantasizing about it then!

00:04:49.625 --> 00:04:51.125
Know what this is?

00:04:51.125 --> 00:04:53.333
A Crow CD?

00:04:53.333 --> 00:04:55.917
Isn't that the discontinued one?

00:04:55.917 --> 00:04:57.750
Huh? Why'd it get discontinued?

00:04:57.750 --> 00:05:01.292
--Crow broke up, right?
--Hey, so what are you doing for summer vacation?

00:05:01.292 --> 00:05:02.833
--Where did you get it?
--Huh?

00:05:02.833 --> 00:05:06.500
I've got a tournament right after
the break, so I'll be pretty busy.

00:05:06.500 --> 00:05:09.458
But I'll make the time at
some point, and... Oh, I know!

00:05:09.458 --> 00:05:11.708
Wanna go on a little vacation?

00:05:11.708 --> 00:05:15.667
After all, this is our last summer
vacation as high schoolers.

00:05:15.667 --> 00:05:17.333
Gotta make sure to enjoy it!

00:05:17.333 --> 00:05:19.625
I'm afraid I can't.

00:05:19.625 --> 00:05:21.625
Why not? Student council stuff?

00:05:21.625 --> 00:05:24.208
Ah! Cramming for entrance exams, right?

00:05:24.208 --> 00:05:26.708
It's not that.

00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:33.292
Aoi!

00:05:33.292 --> 00:05:36.500
Why? Why won't you let it go?

00:05:44.500 --> 00:05:45.958
Stand up!

00:05:46.958 --> 00:05:48.667
Well, we'll talk later.

00:05:48.667 --> 00:05:49.917
Okay.

00:05:51.083 --> 00:05:52.292
Bow!

00:05:56.458 --> 00:05:58.083
Return to your seats.

00:05:58.083 --> 00:06:02.125
Well, this will be my third time
lecturing here, and as you know,

00:06:02.125 --> 00:06:06.958
today's lecture will cover
questions that came up on previous...

00:06:08.542 --> 00:06:11.833
It was a demon that attacked you.

00:06:11.833 --> 00:06:13.375
A demon?

00:06:13.375 --> 00:06:16.208
Demon? You mean, like...

00:06:16.208 --> 00:06:18.375
Demons do indeed exist.

00:06:18.375 --> 00:06:22.250
They have appeared numerous
times throughout history.

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:25.500
They have remained in
the shadows of late though.

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:29.417
Then, could the murders that
have been happening in town...

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:34.708
But how do you know, Kisaragi?

00:06:34.708 --> 00:06:40.708
For generations it has been my family's duty
to fight these creatures of the darkness.

00:06:40.708 --> 00:06:44.958
I would never have imagined
you'd become involved, My Lady.

00:06:44.958 --> 00:06:47.750
I can't believe that!

00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:51.208
But you've seen it with your own eyes!

00:06:51.208 --> 00:06:52.625
That's true, but...

00:06:52.625 --> 00:06:57.125
Okay, so like, this "power" we used...

00:06:57.125 --> 00:06:59.208
What is that?

00:06:59.208 --> 00:07:00.292
I don't know.

00:07:00.292 --> 00:07:01.125
Huh?

00:07:01.125 --> 00:07:04.708
And, even if I did explain in full,

00:07:04.708 --> 00:07:06.625
you'd probably be unable to comprehend it all.

00:07:06.625 --> 00:07:08.750
What was that?!

00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:10.417
Kisaragi...

00:07:13.417 --> 00:07:15.792
There is something known as the "Dragon Stream."

00:07:15.792 --> 00:07:17.292
Dragon Stream?

00:07:17.292 --> 00:07:19.875
It's the name of a current of "chi"
that flows throughout the earth.

00:07:19.875 --> 00:07:24.583
Ah, I know about that!
It's, y'know, that Feng Shui stuff, right?

00:07:24.583 --> 00:07:29.917
Like how they say where you put stuff in your
foyer or living room determines your happiness.

00:07:29.917 --> 00:07:32.958
You pretendin' to be some
fancy pants fortune teller or something?

00:07:32.958 --> 00:07:34.000
Kyouichi...

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:35.625
What's the problem?

00:07:35.625 --> 00:07:38.625
There has been a disturbance in the dragon current.

00:07:38.625 --> 00:07:43.417
That could have something to do
with the resurgence of the demons.

00:07:43.417 --> 00:07:47.125
Not to mention your powers, as well as...

00:07:47.125 --> 00:07:49.875
In any event, I shall resolve matters.

00:07:49.875 --> 00:07:54.750
Until then, I ask that you please
be sure to stay out of trouble.

00:07:54.750 --> 00:07:57.250
I trust that is understood, My Lady?

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:09.625
Where the heck did Aoi go?

00:08:09.625 --> 00:08:14.750
S-Sakurai, I brought some
meat and potato stew today,

00:08:14.750 --> 00:08:19.750
but I made a little too much,
so if you'd like to eat with me...

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:21.500
Aoi!

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:24.833
S-Sakurai!

00:08:24.833 --> 00:08:27.000
It took me three days to learn how to make it.

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:30.250
Here you go, nice and hot.

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:32.417
I'll bring the bowl back on my way home, okay?

00:08:32.417 --> 00:08:34.583
I appreciate it, Kyochee!

00:08:34.583 --> 00:08:36.417
Don't call me that!

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:41.750
What?

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:45.292
I wanted to thank you for the other day.

00:08:45.292 --> 00:08:46.333
Thank me?

00:08:46.333 --> 00:08:47.917
When we were attacked by that Moryo demon.

00:08:47.917 --> 00:08:49.125
Oh, that...

00:08:49.125 --> 00:08:53.625
If you two hadn't been on watch on your own,

00:08:53.625 --> 00:08:56.708
someone else may have fallen victim.

00:08:56.708 --> 00:08:59.583
Thank you so much.

00:08:59.583 --> 00:09:03.125
That was your plan from the start, wasn't it?

00:09:03.125 --> 00:09:04.667
Huh?

00:09:04.667 --> 00:09:10.042
If we had all been in one spot,
the demon may have gotten away.

00:09:10.042 --> 00:09:12.292
You anticipated that and...

00:09:12.292 --> 00:09:14.292
Let's not read too much into this, okay?

00:09:14.292 --> 00:09:15.375
Huh?

00:09:15.375 --> 00:09:19.292
It's just that I can't stomach how
you guys pretend to be all buddy-buddy.

00:09:19.292 --> 00:09:20.583
Houraiji?

00:09:20.583 --> 00:09:24.083
Would you just quit hovering around me?

00:09:24.083 --> 00:09:27.667
I ain't hooking up with you guys, and that's that.

00:09:27.667 --> 00:09:30.792
I really don't give a rat's ass
if anyone dies over this.

00:09:30.792 --> 00:09:34.792
I just wanna test my own strength
against someone who's <i>real </i>tough.

00:09:34.792 --> 00:09:36.250
That's it.

00:09:36.250 --> 00:09:40.458
But even so, none of us
really understand our powers,

00:09:40.458 --> 00:09:46.292
and I'm sure it would be better for us
to join forces and fight together.

00:09:46.292 --> 00:09:48.875
Kisaragi also says it
would be better if we did that.

00:09:48.875 --> 00:09:52.042
You'd only get in the way!

00:09:53.083 --> 00:09:56.000
You wouldn't be able to do
a damn thing in any fight.

00:09:56.000 --> 00:10:00.708
I'd need a lot more than one life
if I teamed up with the likes of you.

00:10:00.708 --> 00:10:03.958
If you don't like it, then go try
doing something useful on your own.

00:10:07.833 --> 00:10:09.833
I'm sorry.

00:10:13.208 --> 00:10:16.292
Aw, hell, now my noodles got all soggy.

00:10:17.375 --> 00:10:19.958
You might have gone a little overboard there.

00:10:19.958 --> 00:10:22.292
I understand how you feel though.

00:10:22.292 --> 00:10:23.958
How I feel?

00:10:25.708 --> 00:10:27.833
Mr. Inugami!

00:10:27.833 --> 00:10:29.708
I thought I'd find you here.

00:10:29.708 --> 00:10:30.375
Huh?

00:10:30.375 --> 00:10:32.292
Don't "huh" me!

00:10:32.292 --> 00:10:34.958
We're going to have a little problem
if you do not attend the meeting.

00:10:34.958 --> 00:10:36.000
Meeting?

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:38.875
About guidance counseling
during summer vacation!

00:10:38.875 --> 00:10:40.125
Ah...

00:10:40.125 --> 00:10:41.792
"Ah"?!

00:10:41.792 --> 00:10:44.125
There have been a lot of
disturbing things going on lately,

00:10:44.125 --> 00:10:47.375
and we don't know what
could happen over the break!

00:10:47.375 --> 00:10:51.417
The students have enough trouble as
it is with entrance exams coming up!

00:10:51.417 --> 00:10:55.542
What are <i>your </i>thoughts on the
situation and how our students feel?

00:10:55.542 --> 00:10:56.708
Oh!

00:10:56.708 --> 00:10:58.625
What is it?

00:10:58.625 --> 00:11:03.292
You're hurt, aren't you? What happened?

00:11:04.250 --> 00:11:08.292
Deplorable! I've had enough!

00:11:10.417 --> 00:11:14.042
Worried about my kids, are you?

00:11:14.042 --> 00:11:16.208
Well, aren't you a model pedagogue?

00:11:19.208 --> 00:11:21.042
These are from Gifu prefecture.

00:11:35.958 --> 00:11:39.375
Are you really going to do it?

00:11:39.375 --> 00:11:44.750
That Kisaragi guy said we
should stay out of trouble.

00:11:45.667 --> 00:11:47.583
Who the heck is that guy anyway?

00:11:47.583 --> 00:11:52.125
He's the son of an antiques dealer that's
done business with our family for generations,

00:11:52.125 --> 00:11:54.917
and now he has inherited his family's business.

00:11:54.917 --> 00:12:00.125
So, he brings us old pots
and that kind of stuff, but...

00:12:00.125 --> 00:12:01.375
But...

00:12:36.917 --> 00:12:38.333
Houraiji?!

00:12:44.250 --> 00:12:45.750
You guys?!

00:12:47.708 --> 00:12:49.042
Daigo?

00:12:49.042 --> 00:12:50.083
Daigo, you also...

00:12:50.083 --> 00:12:52.042
What do you think you're doing?!

00:12:53.875 --> 00:12:58.958
That is not the sort of creature
you can defeat on your own!

00:13:03.958 --> 00:13:06.500
It's utter chaos here!

00:13:06.500 --> 00:13:10.500
Have you ever witnessed a scene
like what you see behind me now?

00:13:10.500 --> 00:13:14.708
Crows! A massive flock of crows
are relentlessly attacking people!

00:13:18.458 --> 00:13:19.625
Look out!

00:13:20.833 --> 00:13:22.792
Ms. Amano?! Ms. Amano!

00:13:44.208 --> 00:13:45.917
Lady Misato, you say?!

00:13:45.917 --> 00:13:49.583
That's right, I got a call
from one of her housekeepers.

00:13:49.583 --> 00:13:54.083
She wasn't at school. I thought
maybe she'd be over here, but...

00:13:55.792 --> 00:13:57.417
It couldn't be!

00:14:00.042 --> 00:14:02.792
Why did you let her go off alone?

00:14:02.792 --> 00:14:07.292
I said the five of you must always
work together against the demons!

00:14:07.292 --> 00:14:09.750
I don't know how many times I've told you!

00:14:09.750 --> 00:14:11.708
<i>That </i>was my condition for assisting you!

00:14:11.708 --> 00:14:13.458
That's easy for you to say and all,

00:14:13.458 --> 00:14:17.292
but we don't know what
she does after she goes home!

00:14:17.292 --> 00:14:20.833
Quickly! Go after Lady Misato right away!

00:14:20.833 --> 00:14:21.917
C'mon, Daigo.

00:14:21.917 --> 00:14:23.917
Uh, right!

00:14:31.667 --> 00:14:33.167
Lady Aoi...

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:40.250
I'm sorry...

00:14:41.375 --> 00:14:44.458
Someone is killed almost every night now.

00:14:44.458 --> 00:14:51.125
I wonder if demons are behind it,
and it makes me so restless.

00:14:51.125 --> 00:14:52.417
That doesn't mean you need to...

00:14:52.417 --> 00:14:54.375
Sorry, I feel the same way.

00:14:54.375 --> 00:14:59.167
I just wanna see how far
my own strength can take me.

00:14:59.167 --> 00:15:00.625
Y'know, Tatsuma?

00:15:00.625 --> 00:15:01.667
Huh?

00:15:01.667 --> 00:15:06.000
Please, Kisaragi! Let me do something too!

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:07.125
Lady Misato...

00:15:07.125 --> 00:15:09.083
I want to do something!

00:15:09.083 --> 00:15:12.333
If there's anything I'd be able to do to help...

00:15:12.333 --> 00:15:15.917
If there's anything I could do to
protect the people in this town...

00:15:17.333 --> 00:15:20.583
Please, Kisaragi!

00:15:24.583 --> 00:15:27.458
The crow disturbance seems
to have abated for the moment.

00:15:27.458 --> 00:15:31.292
However, no one can predict when
the next such attack might occur.

00:15:31.292 --> 00:15:33.417
The experts are divided in
their views of the matter,

00:15:33.417 --> 00:15:37.958
and it will likely take time
before people feel at ease again.

00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:57.708
I'm sorry...

00:16:01.542 --> 00:16:03.417
Rummaging through the trash is one thing,

00:16:03.417 --> 00:16:06.292
but I've never seen crows <i>attack </i>people before.

00:16:06.292 --> 00:16:07.250
Yeah...

00:16:07.250 --> 00:16:12.708
Crows hardly ever attack people.

00:16:12.708 --> 00:16:14.958
Ugh, Anko!

00:16:14.958 --> 00:16:18.458
Crows usually attack people
only during their breeding season.

00:16:18.458 --> 00:16:21.750
Like in cases where a person comes
too close to a nest full of chicks.

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:26.417
But even in those cases, I can't
imagine them attacking in a flock.

00:16:26.417 --> 00:16:30.667
So, what the heck are you doing here anyway?

00:16:30.667 --> 00:16:32.792
I might ask you the same thing!

00:16:32.792 --> 00:16:36.958
What exactly are you two doing
investigating the incident?

00:16:36.958 --> 00:16:39.375
I don't know what you're talking about.

00:16:39.375 --> 00:16:42.000
Nothing, really. Just doing some shopping.

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:43.250
Shopping for what?

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:46.458
Huh? Um, well...

00:16:46.458 --> 00:16:47.583
Underwear!

00:16:47.583 --> 00:16:48.750
Huh?!

00:16:49.542 --> 00:16:52.667
Sheesh, the guy can't lie for shit!

00:16:55.667 --> 00:16:57.500
Damn, that moron!

00:16:59.792 --> 00:17:02.542
Let go, Houraiji!

00:17:03.542 --> 00:17:05.792
I thought I told you to stay outta our way!

00:17:05.792 --> 00:17:07.958
I want to help too!

00:17:07.958 --> 00:17:12.708
I might be weaker and helpless
compared to the rest of you, but...

00:17:12.708 --> 00:17:13.333
But!

00:17:13.333 --> 00:17:15.458
Glad you understand.

00:17:15.458 --> 00:17:17.125
Now get your ass home!

00:17:17.125 --> 00:17:18.167
No!

00:17:18.167 --> 00:17:19.292
What'd you say?

00:17:19.292 --> 00:17:22.625
I won't go home. I won't!

00:17:22.625 --> 00:17:24.375
You little...

00:17:25.208 --> 00:17:26.583
Houraiji!

00:17:28.167 --> 00:17:29.958
You all right, Aoi?

00:17:29.958 --> 00:17:32.208
Cripes, one after another...

00:17:32.208 --> 00:17:37.708
Houraiji! You weren't being
cruel to Aoi again, were you?

00:17:37.708 --> 00:17:40.208
I was just telling her the truth!

00:17:40.208 --> 00:17:42.750
Tellin' her to get her useless ass home.

00:17:42.750 --> 00:17:43.917
What did you say?!

00:17:43.917 --> 00:17:45.458
Stop, Komaki.

00:17:45.458 --> 00:17:48.042
How about you go home with her?

00:17:48.042 --> 00:17:52.000
You just wanna have fun with
the little lady anyway, right?

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:55.208
So, go play house with her
at her own house or whatever.

00:17:55.208 --> 00:17:56.083
Why you!

00:17:56.083 --> 00:17:57.583
Sakurai...

00:17:57.583 --> 00:18:01.792
Isn't it time you gave up the
"daddy will protect you" schtick, Daigo?

00:18:01.792 --> 00:18:03.917
Kyouichi, you sonnuva...

00:18:03.917 --> 00:18:05.375
Stop it, everyone!

00:18:05.375 --> 00:18:06.792
What's going on?

00:18:06.792 --> 00:18:08.167
Dunno...

00:18:17.083 --> 00:18:18.375
A demon?

00:18:36.458 --> 00:18:37.792
A person?

00:18:37.792 --> 00:18:40.000
Not a demon?

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:42.958
You telling me he has powers?

00:18:42.958 --> 00:18:45.167
Oh! That guy!

00:18:48.333 --> 00:18:50.458
Things have gotten interesting.

00:18:50.458 --> 00:18:53.292
Shall we tell him?

00:18:53.292 --> 00:18:55.042
That his enemies are here?

00:18:55.042 --> 00:18:57.208
You son of a bitch!

00:18:57.208 --> 00:19:01.042
Guess I was right that you weren't
any ordinary bunch of onlookers.

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:11.792
Kyouichi!

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:14.625
--No!
--But Komaki!

00:19:14.625 --> 00:19:15.958
I said no!

00:19:15.958 --> 00:19:19.625
Aoi, you don't have the strength to fight!

00:19:19.625 --> 00:19:21.333
Stay here, Aoi.

00:19:24.125 --> 00:19:25.792
Where's Ryouichi?

00:19:25.792 --> 00:19:28.583
Ryouichi? What are you talking about?

00:19:28.583 --> 00:19:33.708
Don't play dumb! You've all got power.
There's no way you don't know!

00:19:35.250 --> 00:19:40.125
Are you in with Ryouichi? Did he have
something to do with the crow attack?

00:19:40.125 --> 00:19:42.250
I don't know what the hell you're talking about!

00:19:42.250 --> 00:19:44.167
It's all nonsense to me!

00:19:44.167 --> 00:19:46.458
Yeah, like you don't know...

00:19:46.458 --> 00:19:49.917
I'll make you talk, even if
I have to beat it outta you!

00:19:52.625 --> 00:19:54.167
Don't interfere, Daigo!

00:19:54.167 --> 00:19:56.083
Stop trying to tough it out on your own!

00:20:09.792 --> 00:20:12.125
Damn you, Sakurai...

00:20:12.125 --> 00:20:12.958
Sakurai!

00:20:12.958 --> 00:20:14.417
I thought I told you to go home!

00:20:14.417 --> 00:20:17.292
Quiet! You don't tell me what to do!

00:20:17.292 --> 00:20:20.417
Stop it, Kyouichi, Sakurai!

00:20:26.833 --> 00:20:29.167
What, the three of you
together and that's all you got?

00:20:29.167 --> 00:20:31.792
This ain't what I'd consider a jam session!

00:20:31.792 --> 00:20:33.000
Damn it!

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:34.083
C'mon!

00:20:35.583 --> 00:20:37.625
Whoa! He's glowing!

00:20:37.625 --> 00:20:39.667
He's flying! He's glowing again!

00:20:39.667 --> 00:20:41.917
What is it? What's going on?

00:21:09.958 --> 00:21:11.625
Missed that by a hair...

00:21:27.625 --> 00:21:28.875
Misato!

00:21:34.333 --> 00:21:36.000
A-Aoi...

00:21:36.000 --> 00:21:37.208
Misato...

00:21:37.208 --> 00:21:41.083
Friggin' moron, this is no place for you, Milady.

00:21:41.083 --> 00:21:43.542
Get out! Get outta here!

00:21:43.542 --> 00:21:45.292
I'll protect you!

00:21:47.958 --> 00:21:50.333
I'll protect you.

00:21:50.333 --> 00:21:54.708
You sure about this?
You don't seem to have much power.

00:21:54.708 --> 00:22:00.417
You are mistaken.
I do not think we are your enemies.

00:22:00.417 --> 00:22:05.292
You may be after the same thing we are!

00:22:05.292 --> 00:22:09.000
In that case, we should work together!

00:22:09.000 --> 00:22:11.208
And what if I said I couldn't do that?

00:22:11.208 --> 00:22:14.750
Then I will fight you with all I've got.

00:22:14.750 --> 00:22:19.375
To protect my friends and the people in this town!

00:22:19.375 --> 00:22:21.125
Aoi...

00:22:21.125 --> 00:22:23.167
Sounds like fun.

00:22:23.167 --> 00:22:26.167
Then protect 'em if you can!

00:22:42.250 --> 00:22:47.417
<i>I sadly hung my head a bit</i>

00:22:47.417 --> 00:22:52.500
<i>And finally you murmured</i>

00:22:52.500 --> 00:22:56.750
<i>What I heard was a faint goodbye</i>

00:22:56.750 --> 00:23:01.667
<i>Said with all your might</i>

00:23:03.625 --> 00:23:12.958
<i>Our pulses echo in the awkward silence</i>

00:23:12.958 --> 00:23:14.792
<i>We can see each other again</i>

00:23:14.792 --> 00:23:17.250
<i>Let's meet up again some time</i>

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:23.083
<i>Let's each set out in search of our own futures</i>

00:23:23.083 --> 00:23:27.625
<i>For the kindness you gave me for my heartache</i>

00:23:27.625 --> 00:23:32.042
<i>I thank you now</i>

00:23:33.208 --> 00:23:37.833
<i>These flower petals seem just as if</i>

00:23:37.833 --> 00:23:43.458
<i>They were blessing us as we depart on our journeys</i>

00:23:43.458 --> 00:23:47.833
<i>I won't forget your warmth</i>

00:23:47.833 --> 00:23:53.125
<i>That overwhelmed my loneliness</i>

00:23:53.125 --> 00:23:58.208
<i>I thank you now</i>

00:24:07.000 --> 00:24:08.000
"Next Episode"

00:24:10.792 --> 00:24:13.542
"Dark Arts Chapter Fourth Night The Gathering"

00:24:13.542 --> 00:24:17.131
"Tokyo Majin"
"Dark Arts Chapter Fourth Night The Gathering"
